OL,3,GNEWSAMajor shake-up of children's homes
OL,4,Aas five closed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is to be a major shake-up of
OL,7,Fchildren's homes across Somerset after
OL,8,Ffive have been temporarily closed.
OL,10,FOnly three of Somerset Council's nine
OL,11,Fchildren's homes are currently open. It
OL,12,Ffollows Ofsted inspectors ruling one
OL,13,Fhome was "volatile and dangerous".
OL,15,FThe council plans to take over running
OL,16,Fthree of the homes previously operated
OL,17,Fby the Shaw Trust. The remaining six
OL,18,Fhomes will be run by at least two other
OL,19,Forganisations.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
