OL,3,GNEWSAMajor shake-up of children's homes
OL,4,Aas five closed
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leaders said the new plan would
OL,7,F"deliver better outcomes and value for
OL,8,Fmoney for Somerset children". Shaw
OL,9,FTrust CEO Chris Luck previously told
OL,10,Fthe BBC the "combination of the
OL,11,Fchildren and the demand for care has
OL,12,Fchanged".
